```text
include/calculator.hpp
src/calculator.cpp
src/main.cpp
```

Functions:

```cpp
int add(int first, int second);
int subtract(int first, int second);
```

Expected:

```text
7 + 3 = 10
7 - 3 = 4
```

2. Parse one CSV line

Given:

```text
2026-09-20 10:00:01,INFO,Sensor started
```

Store it in a `LogEntry` struct and print:

```text
Timestamp: 2026-09-20 10:00:01
Level: INFO
Message: Sensor started
```

3. Validate CSV lines

For each input, return valid or invalid:

```text
2026-09-20,INFO,Started     → valid
2026-09-20,INFO,            → invalid
2026-09-20,,Started         → invalid
only one field               → invalid
```

